### lib/hx-llmzip-v3: no program to run

The module (246 definitions, all pass) is the codec's model and its theorems (`lz3-thm-codec-lossless`,
`lz3-thm-gemv-hom`, the rotation bijection, the dense/escape split). It defines no C, Metal or main;
`lib/silicon/hx-llm-zip.hypercubical` is the other module of that name. The 145.4 → 103.4 GB
